;; ============================================================================
;; END OF VERIFICATION DOCUMENT
;; ============================================================================
;;
;; Harness implementation notes:
;;
;; The verification harness is a toolbar affordance (top-bar button) that:
;;   1. Parses this buffer for ;; @verify ... blocks
;;   2. For each row, sets up the editor with the @before state
;;   3. Waits for the user to fire the action (keyboard, gamepad, or "Go" button)
;;   4. Compares resulting state against @after
;;   5. Records pass/fail to localStorage key: "useq:verification:<category>:<action>"
;;
;; The harness persists results via the persistence service (src/lib/persistence.ts)
;; using a single compound key. History is append-only with timestamps.
;;
;; For actions without a gamepad binding, the harness shows a "Go" button that
;; programmatically fires the action with the current cursor state.
;;
;; Future: rows can be auto-generated from the action registry (src/lib/keybindings/actions.ts)
;; crossed with the binding tables (defaults.ts). Missing rows = missing coverage.
